<title>USA: Sysco to build Florida distribution center.</title>
<headline>Sysco to build Florida distribution center.</headline>
<dateline>RIVIERA BEACH, Fla. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sysco Corp said on Friday its broke ground on a new distribution center that will employ 325 people.</p>
<p>The 260,000-square-foot facility on unincorporated land near Riviera Beach is expected to be completed by fall 1997. It will house Sysco Food Services of Southeast Florida Inc, a newly formed Sysco subsidiary.</p>
<p>Gordon Graham, currently vice president of Sysco Food Services of Atlanta Inc, was named president and chief executive of the new unit.</p>
<p>Sysco Corp is based in Houston.</p>
</text>
